# Real student data must never be committed, hence the blanket rules above.
# sample_data/ is the one exception: it holds only synthetic demo files,
# regenerated by generate_sample_data.py, and Demo Mode needs them present
# in a fresh clone.
!sample_data/**/*.xlsx
!sample_data/**/*.csv

